WEBVTT

00:42.320 --> 00:43.560
Light

00:44.200 --> 00:46.280
will always shine on the geniuses

00:49.080 --> 00:51.320
or the ones who are more special
than others.

00:55.680 --> 00:58.760
It will never shine on the losers.

01:15.320 --> 01:18.440
Our world only has space for the geniuses.

01:19.120 --> 01:20.240
What about the ordinary ones?

01:20.800 --> 01:21.680
How will they live?

01:37.200 --> 01:39.920
The first place award
for the Most Outstanding School 

01:40.480 --> 01:42.120
goes to Lerdvithi School.

01:42.200 --> 01:44.400
I would like to invite the headmaster
to give a speech.

01:49.520 --> 01:53.560
It's not easy to come up and speak about
the same thing over and over again,

01:53.640 --> 01:56.640
but it's the pride of Lerdvithi School.

01:57.440 --> 01:59.160
It has already been eight years.

01:59.240 --> 02:00.400
Eight years.

02:01.480 --> 02:03.320
This became possible

02:03.400 --> 02:06.680
not only with the effort
of a particular teacher or a student,

02:06.760 --> 02:08.320
but every single one of them

02:08.400 --> 02:10.960
who has always been reminded to believe

02:11.039 --> 02:13.320
that humans don't have limits.

02:13.920 --> 02:15.800
We can go further.

02:15.880 --> 02:17.400
We can do better.

02:17.480 --> 02:20.080
The word "limit" does not exist.

02:24.920 --> 02:27.600
And when all of us believe
in the same thing,

02:28.280 --> 02:29.520
all goals

02:29.640 --> 02:31.680
-can be achieved.
-You're finally done.

02:31.760 --> 02:32.680
You took so long.

02:32.760 --> 02:34.320
And this award

02:34.400 --> 02:36.720
-is proof of that.
-I was pooping.

02:38.040 --> 02:41.200
-Sometimes, we--
-All geniuses of our school...

02:41.720 --> 02:43.760
His speech is longer than the limit.

02:44.160 --> 02:46.640
Don't complain. It's good for us
because we don't have class.

02:46.720 --> 02:47.800
I'm happy.

02:47.880 --> 02:49.040
I haven't washed my hands yet.

02:49.720 --> 02:54.280
Oh, my god! That was gross.
Do you know what hygiene is?

02:54.360 --> 02:55.440
Finally,

02:56.000 --> 03:00.000
I would like to share with you
the motto of Lerdvithi School.

03:00.520 --> 03:01.840
"Even in darkness,

03:02.240 --> 03:04.000
real diamonds will shine."

03:04.080 --> 03:05.520
Thank you.

04:39.720 --> 04:42.160
Why do you always bring me here
when we go for a walk?

04:42.240 --> 04:44.520
Coming here won't get your name
inscribed on the pole

04:44.600 --> 04:46.400
or get your hands imprinted.

04:47.520 --> 04:48.560
See?

04:48.640 --> 04:51.240
Your name is not on the pole

04:51.320 --> 04:53.680
because you don't care about anything.

04:53.760 --> 04:56.520
It's not on this pole or on that pole.
There's nothing.

04:56.600 --> 04:57.800
Okay.

04:57.880 --> 05:00.880
Why do you have to insult me, too?

05:00.960 --> 05:01.840
Well...

05:02.320 --> 05:03.200
I...

05:04.280 --> 05:05.400
I feel...

05:06.640 --> 05:07.880
jealous.

05:10.000 --> 05:13.760
They're good at studying and sports.

05:14.680 --> 05:16.360
I feel like a loser.

05:16.960 --> 05:18.720
Did someone say something
to upset you again?

05:25.520 --> 05:26.720
Mew,

05:26.800 --> 05:28.800
can you put down your phone and eat first?

05:29.800 --> 05:30.920
Will you?

05:31.000 --> 05:32.200
Just a second, Mom.

05:33.480 --> 05:34.800
You're always like this.

05:34.880 --> 05:36.240
This is why your grades dropped.

05:37.160 --> 05:39.680
Why can't you be like Pang?

05:39.760 --> 05:41.880
-She got into medical school already.
-I got a 3.5 GPA.

05:41.960 --> 05:43.880
I got a silver medal for sports.

05:44.720 --> 05:48.600
But they got a 4.0 GPA and gold medals.

05:50.120 --> 05:52.640
But you don't have to feel bad
because you still have me,

05:52.720 --> 05:54.880
who got a 3.3 GPA

05:54.960 --> 05:57.440
and a bronze medal.

05:58.760 --> 06:00.120
All right.

06:02.720 --> 06:05.040
You both like to console yourselves.

06:05.920 --> 06:08.080
That's why you don't stand out.

06:09.160 --> 06:10.400
In the future,

06:11.000 --> 06:12.960
you will both become burdens to society.

06:13.520 --> 06:14.920
Didn't you listen to the headmaster?

06:15.000 --> 06:17.480
He always says
that when you have no limits,

06:18.200 --> 06:19.520
you will be unstoppable.

06:22.040 --> 06:24.360
Hey, Nanno.
Can you come here for a second?

06:24.800 --> 06:25.680
All right.

06:30.880 --> 06:32.120
Look at Nanno.

06:32.640 --> 06:34.200
She just got here two weeks ago,

06:34.920 --> 06:37.520
but she has already discovered
her special abilities.

06:39.720 --> 06:44.280
Nanno, can you encourage them

06:44.360 --> 06:46.520
to find their special skills?

06:48.120 --> 06:50.160
So they won't turn into parasites

06:50.680 --> 06:53.000
that will pull our school down.

06:53.800 --> 06:54.680
Sure.

06:56.280 --> 06:57.800
Let's go have lunch.

06:57.880 --> 07:00.960
I've prepared special dishes
for the new genius.

07:01.640 --> 07:02.960
-Let's go.
-Okay.

07:07.000 --> 07:08.240
Okay, bye.

07:08.320 --> 07:10.000
"Let's go have lunch.

07:10.080 --> 07:13.960
I've prepared special dishes
for the new genius."

07:14.040 --> 07:15.200
Why did she call her a genius?

07:15.280 --> 07:16.280
Look here.

07:17.800 --> 07:19.120
"Quantum physics.

07:19.200 --> 07:20.840
Buddhism."

07:23.280 --> 07:26.080
Physics and Buddhism?

07:27.680 --> 07:28.680
Really?

07:47.040 --> 07:49.320
It's the same for today.

07:54.200 --> 07:55.480
Attention.

07:56.720 --> 07:58.560
-Hello.
-Hello.

07:58.640 --> 07:59.880
Hello, students.

07:59.960 --> 08:02.440
I have good news for you.

08:02.520 --> 08:06.520
Last week, we already had a genius
named Nanno.

08:06.600 --> 08:08.880
Today, we have a new genius.

08:10.040 --> 08:14.240
This person just won the first prize
from the Thai Literature Association

08:14.320 --> 08:16.600
that was announced last night.

08:17.840 --> 08:19.520
That person is Pui.

08:28.000 --> 08:30.160
Pui, can you say something
to your friends?

08:30.240 --> 08:31.240
Sure.

08:32.000 --> 08:34.159
This is the first time I won this prize.

08:34.559 --> 08:36.000
I'm very proud of myself.

08:36.640 --> 08:39.240
Everyone has their own special skills.

08:39.320 --> 08:40.919
Believe in your potential and release it.

08:41.000 --> 08:42.840
Go beyond your limit

08:43.320 --> 08:46.880
and you can become successful like us.

08:47.280 --> 08:48.280
Thank you.

08:51.840 --> 08:55.480
Pui, thank you very much
for listening to what I said

08:55.560 --> 08:57.360
and for improving yourself.

09:02.760 --> 09:03.800
Pui.

09:04.840 --> 09:07.320
I'll add you to the group chat
of the geniuses, okay?

09:08.080 --> 09:09.040
Okay.

09:16.560 --> 09:18.080
Congratulations, Pui.

09:18.440 --> 09:21.560
You finally discovered
the genius within you.

09:25.040 --> 09:26.440
Thank you very much, Miss Plearn.

09:28.120 --> 09:29.600
Let's go have lunch.

09:29.920 --> 09:30.920
Sure.

09:45.360 --> 09:47.440
MISS PIYARAT SAELIM

09:47.520 --> 09:49.640
1ST PLACE, THAI LITERATURE ASSOCIATION

10:37.640 --> 10:39.120
Why are your hands dirty, Mew?

10:47.120 --> 10:48.480
I've done it before.

10:51.480 --> 10:52.480
What did you do?

10:53.760 --> 10:55.760
Put my hands on someone else's imprint.

10:56.400 --> 10:58.120
I did it on my first day here.

11:01.760 --> 11:02.880
Hey.

11:02.960 --> 11:04.560
Don't you think it's weird

11:04.640 --> 11:07.040
that Pui can suddenly write
a good novel within a week?

11:12.880 --> 11:14.440
Do you want to know the secret?

11:17.280 --> 11:18.280
What secret?

11:18.840 --> 11:20.000
For something like this,

11:20.080 --> 11:22.640
if you want to know, you have to...

11:22.720 --> 11:24.080
Tell me, Nanno.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.720
Okay, I'll tell you.

11:27.520 --> 11:29.440
If you want to become a genius,

11:30.280 --> 11:31.800
all you have to do is go to Google,

11:33.000 --> 11:34.440
press Control-C

11:35.400 --> 11:36.440
and Control-V.

11:38.080 --> 11:39.000
That's it.

11:40.960 --> 11:41.880
Wait.

11:42.720 --> 11:46.520
Are you saying that Pui
was able to write a novel

11:46.600 --> 11:48.120
because she copied it from Google?

11:48.200 --> 11:49.880
Isn't it too harsh to say she copied?

11:49.960 --> 11:53.760
If you ask Pui, she would say
that she got inspiration from it.

11:54.240 --> 11:56.200
It's the inspiration taken from Google

11:56.760 --> 11:58.160
that was just modified a little bit

11:58.720 --> 11:59.880
here and there.

12:01.600 --> 12:06.440
Then, your physics skill is from...

12:07.000 --> 12:07.920
Hey.

12:08.000 --> 12:09.800
Look at the cheerleaders over there.

12:10.400 --> 12:12.200
Do you think they came up
with their own moves?

12:12.600 --> 12:14.360
Also, for film remakes,

12:15.360 --> 12:17.280
how are they originals?

12:17.920 --> 12:19.080
For music notes,

12:21.240 --> 12:22.920
there are only seven of them.

12:23.440 --> 12:25.520
They just recycle the notes.

12:29.800 --> 12:30.760
Hey.

12:31.520 --> 12:33.200
For Miss Plearn's art assignment,

12:33.760 --> 12:34.840
you should try it.

12:38.760 --> 12:40.200
What if I get caught?

12:41.080 --> 12:43.120
No one caught me and Pui.

12:45.120 --> 12:46.600
If you get caught,

12:47.160 --> 12:48.880
you won't be called a genius.

13:00.480 --> 13:01.480
SEARCH

14:50.440 --> 14:51.480
Here.

15:01.640 --> 15:02.640
Nanno.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.480
It's very beautiful, Mew.

15:06.040 --> 15:08.520
Hey, you can print and sell it.

15:09.120 --> 15:10.720
Your family owns a printing shop anyway.

15:15.160 --> 15:16.840
Mew, you haven't finished
your artwork yet?

15:17.600 --> 15:18.720
She finished it.

15:18.800 --> 15:20.600
It's very beautiful, Miss Plearn.

15:22.640 --> 15:24.040
If you're done, then submit it.

15:26.440 --> 15:27.680
Well...

15:27.760 --> 15:30.120
Your friend said it's beautiful,
so I want to see it now.

15:30.600 --> 15:31.480
Come quickly.

15:53.640 --> 15:55.840
-Miss, I...
-Let me see it.

16:12.200 --> 16:14.920
Please tell me that you did this yourself.

16:20.080 --> 16:22.200
-Well...
-It's very good.

16:24.800 --> 16:28.040
You can enter
the Siam Arts Competition with this.

16:30.240 --> 16:31.520
Look at this, students.

16:32.080 --> 16:33.800
I will submit this to represent our school

16:33.880 --> 16:35.160
in the competition.

16:35.880 --> 16:37.320
I believe in you,

16:37.680 --> 16:40.320
and I hope that the other students
can learn from you.

16:41.720 --> 16:42.880
That's awesome, Mew.

16:57.480 --> 17:03.080
THE FIRST STEP TO SUCCESS.
THANK YOU FOR THE PRIZE, SIAM ARTS.

17:05.800 --> 17:08.160
MISS NICHANART SITTHIBAWORNCHOT
YOUTH WINNER OF SIAM ARTS

17:11.160 --> 17:12.119
Mew.

17:13.560 --> 17:14.960
I'm very happy

17:15.040 --> 17:18.440
that our school finally has an art genius.

17:19.880 --> 17:21.599
We have one for sports,

17:21.680 --> 17:23.480
academics,

17:23.560 --> 17:24.880
and music.

17:26.040 --> 17:27.520
We only lacked in this area.

17:27.599 --> 17:30.600
You really helped the school
overcome its shortcoming.

17:35.080 --> 17:36.840
If so, then I'm happy.

17:39.680 --> 17:41.400
Let's go have lunch.

17:42.280 --> 17:43.160
Sure.

17:58.840 --> 17:59.920
Mew.

18:00.560 --> 18:01.560
Congratulations.

18:09.200 --> 18:10.920
Are you still mad at me?

18:17.720 --> 18:18.720
Yeah.

18:19.520 --> 18:23.360
Since we're both geniuses now,

18:23.440 --> 18:25.280
can we be friends again?

18:29.280 --> 18:31.440
A genius who copied other people's work?

18:33.760 --> 18:34.880
I'm sorry.

18:35.360 --> 18:37.320
I don't think I can be
at the same level as you.

18:39.120 --> 18:40.080
Mew.

18:44.360 --> 18:45.320
Mew.

18:53.760 --> 18:56.280
EVERYONE, I ADDED MEW TO THE GROUP.

18:56.360 --> 18:57.680
HELLO, MEW.

18:57.760 --> 19:00.400
HELLO.

19:00.480 --> 19:02.120
HELLO, EVERYONE.

19:02.200 --> 19:04.560
MISS PLEARN BOUGHT ME A MEAL.

19:08.400 --> 19:09.800
SHE TREATED YOU BETTER THAN ME.

19:09.880 --> 19:11.560
YOU HAVE A LOT OF FOLLOWERS
ON SOCIAL MEDIA.

19:11.640 --> 19:13.880
IF I WERE AS GOOD AS YOU,
I WOULDN'T HAVE KEPT IT A SECRET.

19:13.960 --> 19:16.000
YOU MUST HAVE BEEN PRACTICING, RIGHT?

19:16.080 --> 19:18.320
YEAH.

19:18.400 --> 19:20.240
YOUR NEXT PAINTING MUST BE AWESOME.

19:20.320 --> 19:21.800
THAT'S FOR SURE.

19:21.880 --> 19:25.560
I WANT TO SEE THE NEXT ONE ALREADY.

19:27.720 --> 19:31.080
IT TAKES TIME.

19:31.160 --> 19:35.160
JUST A DRAFT IS FINE.
I WANT TO SEE IT TONIGHT.

20:06.280 --> 20:08.160
Mom, why didn't you knock on the door?

20:10.600 --> 20:13.280
I just brought you soy milk.

20:13.880 --> 20:15.480
There you go. Drink it now.

20:21.960 --> 20:23.760
You know what?

20:23.840 --> 20:27.160
Ever since you won the award
from Siam Arts,

20:27.240 --> 20:29.360
your dad has been praising you every day.

20:29.440 --> 20:33.240
He praises you for this and that
every day and all day.

20:34.400 --> 20:38.600
It's because you are cute and talented.

20:43.920 --> 20:45.160
-Hey, Mom!
-I'm leaving.

20:46.280 --> 20:48.400
-What was that for?
-Finish the soy milk.

20:48.480 --> 20:49.480
Get out.

21:25.600 --> 21:29.760
WE BECOME SUCCESSFUL WHEN
WE DO THINGS WE THOUGHT WE COULDN'T.

21:30.400 --> 21:33.720
INSPIRATION COMES FROM WITHIN OURSELVES.

21:33.800 --> 21:38.800
NEVER BELIEVE THAT HUMANS HAVE LIMITS.
I DREW THIS WITH MY LEFT HAND.

21:38.880 --> 21:39.800
Hey.

21:40.480 --> 21:42.520
I really like your artwork, Mew.

21:42.600 --> 21:45.480
Your artwork is very advanced.

21:45.560 --> 21:48.840
They reminded me of artists
like Jackson Pollock.

21:50.400 --> 21:52.280
I've been admiring your artwork
for a long time.

21:53.200 --> 21:55.000
You finally became a genius, too.

21:55.080 --> 21:56.960
Beautiful trees are in the forest.

21:57.040 --> 21:59.240
The wide sky is full of stars.

21:59.320 --> 22:00.720
The star of art is you.

22:00.800 --> 22:03.560
The art circles will be developed further.

22:03.800 --> 22:06.920
There would be something interesting
for people to see.

22:08.240 --> 22:09.200
An artist?

22:09.280 --> 22:10.120
MEW, THE ART GENIUS

22:10.200 --> 22:12.240
I'm not sure about that.

22:12.680 --> 22:15.440
Salvador Dali once said,

22:15.520 --> 22:22.200
"A true artist isn't someone
who needs inspiration,

22:22.480 --> 22:25.920
but someone who inspires other people."

22:26.960 --> 22:27.800
Well...

22:28.280 --> 22:32.920
I'm not sure
if I can call myself an artist yet.

22:33.000 --> 22:37.240
But if there are people
who started to draw

22:37.320 --> 22:40.720
and create works of art because of me,

22:40.800 --> 22:43.680
I think that's when
I can call myself an artist.

22:45.200 --> 22:46.520
As I said before,

22:47.080 --> 22:49.880
"Even in darkness,
real diamonds will shine."

22:51.280 --> 22:52.160
Yes.

22:52.720 --> 22:53.600
Yes.

23:15.840 --> 23:18.840
Yes, our school will organize
an open house event

23:18.920 --> 23:22.960
to showcase the works
of our genius students.

23:24.400 --> 23:28.160
The headmaster has decided
that it will happen next week.

23:28.240 --> 23:32.200
We would like to ask all geniuses
to prepare for this event.

23:33.160 --> 23:34.160
For Mew,

23:34.680 --> 23:36.400
I'm very proud of you

23:36.880 --> 23:40.520
for winning the first prize
from Siam Arts.

23:41.280 --> 23:44.840
I'll let you display
and present your work onstage.

23:45.960 --> 23:49.360
Miss Plearn,
the presentation will be repetitive.

23:49.800 --> 23:51.440
Wouldn't that be too boring?

23:53.600 --> 23:55.000
That's what I thought, too.

23:56.120 --> 23:57.080
Then...

23:58.400 --> 24:00.440
Mew should create an artwork onstage.

24:02.880 --> 24:03.800
Well,

24:04.600 --> 24:05.600
Miss Plearn,

24:07.320 --> 24:10.240
I don't think anybody
would want to see it.

24:10.800 --> 24:11.960
I want to see it.

24:12.040 --> 24:13.840
Yeah, I want to see it, too.

24:14.680 --> 24:16.240
-Me, too.
-Me, too.

24:17.760 --> 24:19.520
See? Everyone wants to see it.

24:19.600 --> 24:21.120
If we advertise it like this,

24:21.200 --> 24:23.200
I'm sure that everyone
would want to see it.

24:24.240 --> 24:26.320
I will invite Siam Arts Association,

24:26.960 --> 24:29.760
reporters, students from other schools,

24:30.240 --> 24:32.480
and the association that ranks schools.

24:33.080 --> 24:34.280
When the association sees it,

24:34.360 --> 24:37.040
we might win for the second time.

24:39.840 --> 24:42.640
I think we should broadcast it live, too.

24:49.520 --> 24:53.440
Yes. Let's do a live broadcast
through the school's Facebook page

24:53.520 --> 24:55.240
so that the whole world can watch.

24:56.240 --> 24:57.200
Oh, my god, Mew.

24:57.280 --> 24:59.080
You'll become famous in our country.

25:22.000 --> 25:22.960
Nanno!

25:24.600 --> 25:25.760
Hey.

25:25.840 --> 25:26.920
Why did you do that?

25:27.600 --> 25:30.040
-You know that...
-What are you scared of?

25:30.680 --> 25:32.200
You are a genius now.

25:33.520 --> 25:35.120
That's bullshit.

25:36.080 --> 25:37.800
You did it on purpose.

25:37.880 --> 25:39.200
What did I do?

25:40.960 --> 25:41.960
You don't know?

25:42.040 --> 25:42.920
You...

25:45.800 --> 25:47.080
Why did you mess with me?

25:47.560 --> 25:49.360
Why don't you mess with Pui instead?

25:49.960 --> 25:52.800
Mew, I didn't get anyone in trouble.

25:53.640 --> 25:56.480
Weren't you the one
who wanted to be a genius

25:56.560 --> 25:57.880
and become famous?

25:58.920 --> 26:00.200
I just helped you.

26:00.880 --> 26:01.880
What did I do wrong?

26:04.440 --> 26:05.960
-You--
-Don't blame me.

26:08.960 --> 26:11.200
Do you fucking realize
what you've done to me?

26:11.800 --> 26:12.680
Mew,

26:13.080 --> 26:14.160
good luck.

26:19.040 --> 26:20.120
Fuck you!

27:13.920 --> 27:15.080
Mew, I brought you some food.

27:15.160 --> 27:16.080
I don't want it!

27:37.320 --> 27:38.680
Hello, Mew.

27:38.760 --> 27:41.360
Are you creating an artwork?

27:42.400 --> 27:45.320
Hey, did you see that post on Facebook?

27:46.840 --> 27:49.520
Someone said that you copied
their friend's artwork,

27:49.600 --> 27:51.360
but I don't know
what happened to the post.

27:52.480 --> 27:53.640
Are you out of your mind?

27:55.320 --> 27:56.160
Mew...

27:56.960 --> 27:58.920
Don't be mean to me.

27:59.000 --> 28:00.920
I'm your fan.

28:01.280 --> 28:03.840
I'll be waiting for your next artwork.

28:06.520 --> 28:07.920
You'll be waiting, right?

28:08.960 --> 28:09.960
Sure.

28:23.120 --> 28:24.000
Pui.

28:24.560 --> 28:26.080
I need your help.

28:41.440 --> 28:44.240
Can we be friends again?

28:58.040 --> 28:58.960
Pui.

29:00.400 --> 29:02.040
You're not mad at me anymore?

29:03.600 --> 29:04.600
Yeah.

29:07.680 --> 29:09.280
Actually, I wasn't mad at you.

29:11.800 --> 29:12.960
I was jealous of you.

29:14.840 --> 29:16.840
I was jealous because you became a genius.

29:19.480 --> 29:22.000
I was jealous because you have
your own piece of work and fame.

29:22.880 --> 29:25.240
You also have a lot of admirers...

29:28.360 --> 29:30.240
while I was still the same stupid person.

29:34.000 --> 29:36.880
Hey, that was a long time ago.

29:36.960 --> 29:39.240
Can we be friends again?

29:42.720 --> 29:43.600
Sure.

29:45.240 --> 29:47.120
But I need your help with something.

29:47.680 --> 29:49.400
Sure. What is it?

29:57.000 --> 29:58.400
Can you hit my arm?

30:03.520 --> 30:06.240
Hey, this is not funny.

30:08.120 --> 30:09.400
I can't draw.

30:10.360 --> 30:11.880
I can't go onstage.

30:11.960 --> 30:13.720
I copied other people's work.

30:15.320 --> 30:16.720
Please help me.

30:17.760 --> 30:18.840
-Please hit me!
-Hey!

30:18.920 --> 30:19.760
Hit me!

30:19.840 --> 30:20.920
-Hey!
-Hit me!

30:21.000 --> 30:23.600
-Mew, calm down.
-No, hit me!

30:23.680 --> 30:25.040
I told you to hit me.

30:25.880 --> 30:28.520
Hit me. You said you would help me
with everything.

30:28.600 --> 30:31.280
-Are you breaking your word?
-No. This is not what I promised.

30:31.360 --> 30:32.720
I'm begging you.

30:32.800 --> 30:35.000
I've helped you with many things.

30:35.080 --> 30:37.400
Can you help me? I'm begging you. Hit me.

30:37.480 --> 30:40.160
-Hit me! Just hit me!
-I can't...

30:40.240 --> 30:41.360
Just hit me!

30:57.400 --> 30:59.560
Can't you just help me with this?

30:59.640 --> 31:00.600
I'm begging you.

31:00.680 --> 31:02.920
I've never asked you for anything before.

31:03.280 --> 31:04.560
Hit me.

31:04.680 --> 31:05.960
Just hit me.

31:06.040 --> 31:07.040
Hit me!

31:13.320 --> 31:14.760
You're not going to hit me?

31:15.800 --> 31:16.800
I'll do it myself then.

31:27.480 --> 31:29.080
Mew! That's enough!

31:29.160 --> 31:31.360
Stop it!

31:34.520 --> 31:36.040
Mew, what the fuck is wrong with you?

31:38.480 --> 31:39.720
What the fuck is wrong with you?

31:41.240 --> 31:42.160
Mew.

31:44.720 --> 31:46.280
What the fuck is wrong with you?

31:47.680 --> 31:49.160
Why did you do this to me?

31:54.960 --> 31:56.440
You were the one who hit me.

31:58.160 --> 31:59.560
Why did you hit me?

32:00.080 --> 32:02.880
-Hey, I didn't do anything.
-You hit me.

32:04.600 --> 32:06.200
I didn't do it.

32:07.600 --> 32:09.640
You were the one who hit me.

32:11.600 --> 32:13.040
Why did you hit me?

32:18.600 --> 32:19.520
Mew.

32:20.920 --> 32:22.520
Help me!

32:22.600 --> 32:23.560
Mew.

32:24.120 --> 32:25.880
It hurts.

32:25.960 --> 32:27.280
It hurts!

32:29.960 --> 32:31.200
Help me!

32:31.280 --> 32:33.640
-Mew!
-Mew!

32:34.120 --> 32:36.160
-What's this?
-What happened?

32:36.240 --> 32:38.480
-Pui hit me.
-Why did you do this, Pui?

32:38.880 --> 32:41.320
What were you thinking? You hurt her.

32:41.400 --> 32:44.240
-Why did you do this, Pui? Why?
-I feel sorry for you, Mew.

32:44.880 --> 32:46.440
Why did you do this to me?

32:46.520 --> 32:48.800
-Mew.
-Careful. Are you okay?

32:48.880 --> 32:50.400
It hurts.

32:50.480 --> 32:52.840
Mew, are you okay?

33:20.920 --> 33:22.560
What a shame.

33:23.360 --> 33:26.680
I wanted to see you
create an artwork onstage.

33:27.720 --> 33:29.480
But this happened.

33:30.080 --> 33:32.480
Now I have to sit here
and treat your wound instead.

33:35.880 --> 33:39.320
Your dad was going to
close the shop to watch you.

33:39.880 --> 33:43.080
He also invited your grandma and aunties.

33:44.880 --> 33:46.640
Luckily, I stopped them in time,

33:47.160 --> 33:48.880
or they might have gone for nothing.

33:50.320 --> 33:53.080
Yeah, I feel sorry about it, too.

34:00.080 --> 34:02.400
By the way, what happened?

34:02.880 --> 34:05.920
How did you and Pui end up
fighting with each other?

34:07.240 --> 34:09.239
You've been friends
since childhood, right?

34:14.920 --> 34:15.880
I'll get it.

34:21.920 --> 34:24.600
-Oh, Hello, Miss Plearn.
-Hello.

34:24.719 --> 34:26.000
Please come in.

34:26.760 --> 34:29.360
Mew, your teacher and friends
came to see you.

34:35.400 --> 34:36.600
Is your hand getting better?

34:38.800 --> 34:39.760
Not yet.

34:41.040 --> 34:42.040
Don't worry.

34:42.120 --> 34:45.080
The school punished Pui
by not letting her display her work.

34:46.000 --> 34:48.880
If she didn't win any award,
we would have expelled her.

34:51.639 --> 34:53.239
Pui was so violent towards you.

34:54.239 --> 34:56.360
We didn't know
that she would be like that.

34:58.040 --> 34:59.160
How are you?

34:59.880 --> 35:01.640
Can you move your fingers a little bit?

35:01.720 --> 35:02.960
Can you try to move them?

35:04.040 --> 35:05.760
You might still be able to go onstage.

35:12.880 --> 35:14.520
I can't. It still hurts.

35:16.080 --> 35:17.760
You already went to see the doctor.

35:17.840 --> 35:19.240
Your hand is still not better?

35:21.280 --> 35:24.320
My arm is still like this.
How can it get better?

35:26.400 --> 35:28.400
Lerdvithi School's open house

35:29.920 --> 35:31.200
will definitely fail.

35:37.960 --> 35:40.520
Do you remember
what the headmaster always says, Mew?

35:42.120 --> 35:45.440
"Even in darkness,
real diamonds will shine."

35:46.920 --> 35:49.720
If I were you, I would go onstage.

35:50.480 --> 35:52.680
I wouldn't let the school
lose its reputation.

35:53.320 --> 35:55.440
But if I go onstage and don't do well,

35:56.200 --> 35:58.120
it will ruin our school's reputation
even more.

36:04.360 --> 36:06.240
But you can still use
your left arm, right?

36:06.840 --> 36:08.680
You posted it on Instagram before.

36:10.240 --> 36:11.120
Right?

36:14.200 --> 36:16.040
I'll look it up for you.

36:16.120 --> 36:17.080
Can I borrow your phone?

36:22.520 --> 36:24.840
I DREW THIS WITH MY LEFT HAND.

36:26.120 --> 36:28.760
So, you can go onstage then.

36:30.840 --> 36:32.320
Congrats, Mew.

36:32.720 --> 36:34.760
You can show your special skills now.

37:21.560 --> 37:23.440
Not a sound from people can be heard.

37:23.520 --> 37:25.240
The leaves drift and the birds sing.

37:25.320 --> 37:27.120
We hear the sound of hidden corruption.

37:27.200 --> 37:28.280
Thank you.

37:56.160 --> 37:57.240
Hello, everyone.

37:58.240 --> 37:59.600
The next performance

38:00.800 --> 38:04.000
must be what everyone
has been waiting for the whole day.

38:04.640 --> 38:05.920
It's time

38:06.800 --> 38:09.200
for the spotlight to shine

38:09.800 --> 38:13.240
on the recent genius of Lerdvithi School.

38:14.520 --> 38:17.160
She's the art genius.

38:17.920 --> 38:22.600
It's Miss Nichanart Sitthibawornchot

38:22.680 --> 38:23.880
or Mew.

38:26.440 --> 38:28.440
-Miss, I don't--
-Are you ready?

38:29.080 --> 38:30.080
I know you are.

38:31.080 --> 38:32.400
You have to go onstage right now.

38:33.840 --> 38:35.160
I believe in you.

38:35.880 --> 38:36.880
Mew.

38:36.960 --> 38:38.840
-Miss...
-Mew.

38:40.160 --> 38:41.720
You are my genius.

38:44.160 --> 38:48.360
Mew is considered as an art genius

38:49.560 --> 38:51.360
because she can create

38:52.080 --> 38:53.960
amazing works of art

38:55.120 --> 38:58.400
in just a short period of time.

39:00.240 --> 39:02.160
And even though she was in an accident,

39:02.240 --> 39:04.320
that couldn't stop her
from performing onstage.

39:05.440 --> 39:06.320
Today,

39:07.040 --> 39:11.760
everyone will see how Mew will do it.

39:13.840 --> 39:15.640
Prepare your cell phones.

39:16.200 --> 39:18.040
We will be doing a live broadcast.

39:18.800 --> 39:22.480
The whole world will see this art genius,

39:23.360 --> 39:26.200
a living legend.

39:52.800 --> 39:54.400
Mew, go, go!

39:54.640 --> 39:59.320
Mew, go, go!

39:59.880 --> 40:04.800
Mew, go, go!

40:04.880 --> 40:08.040
Mew, go, go!

40:08.120 --> 40:14.120
Mew, go, go!

40:14.200 --> 40:17.720
Mew, go, go!

40:17.800 --> 40:22.080
Mew, go, go!

40:22.160 --> 40:23.280
You thief!

40:24.640 --> 40:26.520
You stole my Indonesian friend's artwork!

40:26.600 --> 40:27.800
That's nonsense!

40:28.640 --> 40:29.880
It's not nonsense.

40:29.960 --> 40:32.360
She really stole my friend's work.

40:32.840 --> 40:33.840
Here.

40:34.640 --> 40:35.480
Where is it?

40:35.560 --> 40:38.720
The artwork you all praised
and said, "Wow, it's very good."

40:38.800 --> 40:40.560
She just stole someone else's artwork

40:40.680 --> 40:42.280
and splashed colors on it.

40:42.360 --> 40:43.280
Isn't it true?

40:45.000 --> 40:46.000
I didn't...

40:46.080 --> 40:48.520
The evidence is right
in front of your eyes. Tell them.

40:49.080 --> 40:51.080
Tell them you think this school is stupid.

40:52.440 --> 40:55.200
The Siam Arts Association is also
stupid enough to get fooled by you.

40:56.040 --> 40:56.960
Look at it carefully.

40:58.800 --> 40:59.880
You can lie to others,

40:59.960 --> 41:01.480
but you can't lie to yourself.

41:01.960 --> 41:03.360
Can I see it?

41:08.880 --> 41:11.200
It doesn't look like Mew's artwork at all.

41:15.320 --> 41:17.040
Which school are you from?

41:17.600 --> 41:19.440
"DWY."

41:19.520 --> 41:20.800
Dwy.

41:20.880 --> 41:22.320
It's Denwittaya School.

41:22.400 --> 41:23.320
I see.

41:23.400 --> 41:27.560
It's the rival school
that is always in second place.

41:28.120 --> 41:31.400
The school that follows our every move.

41:31.480 --> 41:34.200
Whether we go to the left or the right,

41:34.280 --> 41:37.160
your school follows our every step.

41:37.240 --> 41:39.000
This has nothing to do with my school.

41:39.080 --> 41:40.960
Of course it does.

41:41.600 --> 41:44.440
You want to destroy our reputation,

41:44.520 --> 41:46.760
so you are accusing our student like this.

41:49.280 --> 41:50.680
I'm telling you the truth.

41:51.120 --> 41:53.880
Are you really telling the truth?

41:54.600 --> 41:57.360
How well do you know art?

41:57.440 --> 41:59.280
How could you accuse
our student like this?

42:02.920 --> 42:03.880
Confess.

42:06.760 --> 42:08.880
If you don't confess,
draw us a picture instead.

42:08.960 --> 42:10.960
Create an artwork just like this one.

42:11.400 --> 42:12.360
Do it!

42:12.440 --> 42:14.440
So they will see what is real
and what is fake.

42:15.320 --> 42:16.400
Do it, Mew.

42:17.000 --> 42:19.840
Do it so that she stops talking nonsense.

42:21.080 --> 42:22.080
Do it, Mew.

42:23.600 --> 42:24.600
Mew, do it.

42:26.720 --> 42:27.640
Do it.

42:28.920 --> 42:31.080
Do it.

42:31.160 --> 42:35.520
-Do it.
-Do it.

42:35.600 --> 42:40.800
Do it.

42:40.880 --> 42:46.160
Do it.

42:46.240 --> 42:51.360
Do it.

42:51.440 --> 42:56.880
Do it.

42:56.960 --> 42:58.960
Do it...

43:50.480 --> 43:51.560
You see?

43:51.640 --> 43:52.760
It's exactly the same.

43:53.560 --> 43:56.440
It looks exactly like the one she drew.

43:57.040 --> 44:00.200
This is the real genius.

44:04.360 --> 44:05.440
Her artwork

44:06.400 --> 44:09.840
is gentle but powerful.

44:11.760 --> 44:14.520
This is a real work of art.

44:15.280 --> 44:16.920
It's impossible

44:17.000 --> 44:20.160
that Lerdvithi School
and Siam Arts Association

44:20.600 --> 44:24.400
would praise a fake artwork
or a fake person.

44:24.480 --> 44:26.760
Are you crazy?
They don't look the same at all!

44:27.680 --> 44:28.680
You are the crazy one.

44:28.760 --> 44:31.560
Why can't you see that they look the same?

44:31.640 --> 44:33.600
Why can't you see that Mew is a genius?

44:33.680 --> 44:34.800
Because they're not the same.

44:34.880 --> 44:36.760
-They're not the same. Look!
-Stop.

44:37.320 --> 44:39.880
Stop accusing Mew, Siam Arts Association,

44:39.960 --> 44:41.400
and Lerdvithi School already.

44:41.480 --> 44:43.400
I'm not accusing anyone.
I'm telling the truth.

44:43.480 --> 44:46.760
The truth is that you are
from Denwittaya School,

44:46.840 --> 44:48.560
the forever-second-place school.

44:48.640 --> 44:51.560
You just want to discredit
Lerdvithi School

44:51.640 --> 44:53.320
and Siam Arts Association.

44:54.240 --> 44:55.160
Get out now.

44:55.240 --> 44:56.080
Guard.

44:57.920 --> 44:59.200
Stop. I can walk by myself.

45:01.120 --> 45:02.880
Are you blaming me for discrediting you?

45:04.400 --> 45:05.920
-What are you booing at?
-Get out!

45:06.000 --> 45:09.200
You are all stupid!
You can't even tell what art is!

45:09.280 --> 45:10.200
Get out!

45:10.280 --> 45:11.480
What is wrong with you?

45:11.560 --> 45:15.400
She was so rude that it was obvious
she's from that second-rate school.

45:19.080 --> 45:22.040
You must have been shocked
by this crazy situation.

45:23.680 --> 45:24.760
Don't worry.

45:26.200 --> 45:27.760
She's just jealous.

45:29.160 --> 45:31.240
You are already a genius.

45:31.800 --> 45:34.800
No one can destroy you.

45:36.760 --> 45:39.040
I'm really proud of you, Mew.

45:39.480 --> 45:42.400
You are a role model
for the students of Lerdvithi School,

45:42.880 --> 45:44.960
and an example of the geniuses.

45:45.360 --> 45:48.280
You are living up to the motto
of Lerdvithi School.

45:48.360 --> 45:51.240
"Even in darkness,
real diamonds will shine."

45:56.680 --> 45:57.560
Yes.

45:58.120 --> 45:59.920
Now that everything has settled down,

46:00.360 --> 46:03.040
let's listen to Mew's speech

46:03.680 --> 46:05.440
that might inspire all of us today.

46:45.440 --> 46:46.800
"Thank you, everyone,

46:47.560 --> 46:49.280
for supporting me,

46:51.640 --> 46:53.320
standing by me,

46:54.560 --> 46:56.160
and believing in who I am.

46:59.040 --> 47:00.520
I really appreciate

47:02.600 --> 47:04.440
that everyone has gathered here today

47:05.840 --> 47:07.160
to fight for me.

47:10.360 --> 47:11.640
I believe

47:12.200 --> 47:14.840
that what we fought for today

47:16.080 --> 47:17.720
will be a good example

47:19.120 --> 47:20.240
for the...

47:22.440 --> 47:24.040
It will be a good example

47:24.960 --> 47:26.200
for the society

47:27.600 --> 47:29.200
to learn about love

47:30.840 --> 47:32.240
and unity.

47:34.320 --> 47:39.120
This would make our society stable
in the future to come

47:41.720 --> 47:43.920
under the leadership of the geniuses

47:44.960 --> 47:46.440
of Lerdvithi School.

47:48.720 --> 47:49.960
Finally,

47:51.120 --> 47:54.080
I would like to end this speech
with the motto of Lerdvithi School.

47:56.280 --> 47:57.480
'Even in darkness,

47:59.160 --> 48:00.440
real diamonds will shine.'"

48:31.640 --> 48:34.760
I wish you happiness in this world, Mew.

50:02.640 --> 50:04.640
Subtitle translation by Tanida Itthiwat
